<title>GERMANY: Buba says Sept adjusted jobless rate 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Buba says Sept adjusted jobless rate 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank reported the following seasonally adjusted unemployment rates (pct)</p>
<p>PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT	Sep 96     Aug 96     Sep 95</p>
<p> Rate				 10.4	 10.3	 9.6</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				  9.3	  9.1	 8.4</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				 15.3	 15.2	14.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Labour Office earlier reported the bulk of the jobless figures.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
